{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16855","headline":"赠韩退之 · 张署","name":"赠韩退之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九疑峰畔二江前，恋阙思乡日抵年。\n白简趋朝曾竝命，苍梧左宦一聊翩。\n鲛人远泛渔舟水，鵩鸟闲飞露里天。\n涣汗几时流率土，扁舟西下共归田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张署","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16855.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16855","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}